# Antumbra takes only these packages from trixie-backports; everything else
# stays on trixie (backports' own priority is 100). Copied into the chroot
# before the first package is installed (build/rootfs.sh) and kept in the
# image for the same effect at runtime.

Explanation: the camera: libcamera 0.7 and the PipeWire stack built against it
Explanation: (trixie's libspa-0.2-libcamera links libcamera 0.4)
Package: libcamera* gstreamer1.0-libcamera pipewire* libpipewire-0.3-* libspa-0.2-* wireplumber libwireplumber-0.5-* gstreamer1.0-pipewire
Pin: release n=trixie-backports
Pin-Priority: 500

Explanation: Android apps (Waydroid), only in builds with ANTUMBRA_ANDROID=1
Package: waydroid python3-gbinder libgbinder* libglibutil*
Pin: release n=trixie-backports
Pin-Priority: 500
